# The fix (opt-in, not the shipped build): a confirmation counts only if the caller began the answer after
# the read-back finished playing. Apply to a copy of this folder: `patch -p1 < fix.diff`
# (make fix-copy FW=strands). Measured by shared/spec/count_concerns.py strands --diff-file fix.diff.
